00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:17.720
Who's steppin'?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.480
Okay.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.940
Let's move on.

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:21.360
Ooh.

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.240
That looks nice.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:26.300
Wait, was that a door-- was that door slightly ajar? It was, okay.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:26.980
Hello?

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:28.360
Hi.

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:29.460
'kay what's the point of this then?

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.020
[shaking doorknob]

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:31.640
Oh there is no point!

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:33.240
Oh, okay, never mind, then.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:34.200
Alright.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:35.460
Let's get a move on!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:37.680
You only got [indiscernable mumbling] few places to be..

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:38.880
Hueh.

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:42.240
Okay.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.260
LYNN!

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.480
I'm coming for yo- [disturbed noises]

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:47.400
[quieter] comin' for you very slowly!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:48.980
Hi.

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:50.980
*rustling in the trees*

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.060
Ooh, hey.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:53.160
Ooh, hey..

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:54.100
*more rustling*

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:55.160
Alrighty, then.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.880
Someone just burp?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:03.060
Why is someone burping in the woods?

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:04.960
Euh, it's a boomer!

00:08:05.140 --> 00:08:06.820
A boomer is coming for us.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:09.720
[improper pronunciation of latin sign] "Satan Inimical God"

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:10.920
Hi.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:11.940
How you doin'?

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.320
Nice slogan.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.720
Are you the three-eyed raven?

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.920
Alright here we go.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:17.460
Oh I remember this part!

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:18.920
Oh, this part's bad.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.880
Ooh-ooh this part's bad.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:21.660
Okay, so,

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:25.200
it took me a while to fully comprehend what the hell happened

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:26.440
when I was playing this at PAX,

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.320
But, uh - oooh.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:28.700
Oof.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:29.380
Oof.

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:30.520
That's not a good sign.

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.360
Oof.

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:33.580
So, notice the, uh, euh.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.420
The 'THIS'.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:35.960
Then the blood.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.340
Whatever the hell this is.

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:38.720
Okay.

00:08:38.760 --> 00:08:40.220
*incorrect pronunciation* "Sacrificium"

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:41.320
"Annuntiavi"

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.960
That's a lot of detail to put into this.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:44.300
Oh my God.

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.720
"Listopad"

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.920
Alright. But this isn't the fucked up part.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.460
The fucked up part's over here.

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:52.500
[unhappy groaning]

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.500
It's bad.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.920
It's literally, literally.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.820
It's like - I'm not gonna lie,

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:02.300
I'm pretty sure that's a pit of dead babies.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.980
Like it's... this game is going for fucked up

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.560
and it reaches it

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:08.840
and the worst part is,

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.000
you gotta...

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.860
You gotta walk across it...

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:14.860
*crunching/squishing noises as he walks across*

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.680
[disgusted noises]

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.860
Euhh.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:19.020
Euuhh.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:21.040
'cause I know,

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:24.180
I know Outlast has always been about brutality..

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.880
Oh! Great symbolism here.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.660
Oh with the well.

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:30.920
And I'm pretty sure I thought about this when I came over here

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.280
Love-- [is cut off]

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:34.880
[young girl's indistinct voice]

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.060
Wait, who said that?

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:38.380
Who's talking?!

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.040
[young girl's voice]

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:46.860
I don't remember there being a voice before.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:48.880
Huh, I wonder if I should look face first

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.220
into the well!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:50.900
Huh!

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.360
Maybe that's an intelligent decision to make

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.720
in a town of horrors!

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:55.400
Here we go!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.500
Hey, I'll investigate this

00:09:57.840 --> 00:09:58.960
with my eyeballs!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:09:59.760
[Markiplier screeches]

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.080
And then

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:01.900
that happens.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:03.900
[character screams]

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.420
So that was a smoker

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.620
that pulled me in there.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:12.720
There was a boomer belching in the woods

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:15.280
And everything is going to shit.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.200
So somehow,

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.320
I don't know how-

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.640
[reads screen] "Look behind...left ALT"

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:20.600
Hyaa!

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:22.220
Alrighty there.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.480
No one's over there.

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.600
Is anybody over there?

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:25.760
Hello?

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:26.560
Hyaa!

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.740
Okay - [whispering child]

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:28.900
Hi.

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:30.560
You there.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:31.940
Who's there?

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:33.540
[child whispering] "Don't let this happen..."

00:10:33.760 --> 00:10:35.360
Don't let..  the 'thep'?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:36.240
The, the what?

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:37.280
Wait, hang on.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.540
Where am I?

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:39.380
There we go.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.580
I need to go this way please

00:10:40.580 --> 00:10:41.560
[child whispering] "I'm scared.."

